{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">My Pet Hooligan is a 3rd person shooter platformer where you and your fellow Hooligans battle against Metazuckbot for control over Hooliland City. From a 3rd person perspective, players use a host of unique weapons that are variations on the classics including a water pistol, plunger sniper and lots of others. Game modes include Anarchy, Organized Anarchy, Coinpocalypse and Hangout, these are Hooligan takes on free for all, team deathmatch and open world casual play. With both PvP and PvE experiences as well as exploration and social gameplay elements, there is something for everyone in My Pet Hooligan. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3574840?t=1744323874","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3574840?t=1744323874","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/5baf00a9a25c638aa0605a2839a89d7f0e999aa2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744323874","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/5baf00a9a25c638aa0605a2839a89d7f0e999aa2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744323874","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">My Pet Hooligan is a 3rd person shooter platformer where you and your fellow Hooligans battle against Metazuckbot for control over Hooliland City. From a 3rd person perspective, play